00:47.280 --> 00:54.149
♪ A ray of light, a glimpse of hope ♪

00:54.150 --> 01:01.189
♪ Rising through thorns, a
glimmer through the cracks ♪

01:01.190 --> 01:07.670
♪ Look up and behold, transcending time ♪

01:07.680 --> 01:13.639
♪ Through ages and cataclysms,
I'll stand watch for you ♪

01:13.640 --> 01:20.389
♪ Even millennia later,
I won't forget you ♪

01:20.390 --> 01:25.909
♪ In a world without
you, I'll defy fate itself ♪

01:25.910 --> 01:31.419
♪ Cracks, piercing through the heart ♪

01:31.420 --> 01:38.179
♪ Armoured, at the
end of a vast battlefield ♪

01:38.180 --> 01:44.540
♪ Light slipping through my fingers ♪

01:44.550 --> 01:51.300
♪ My fate, under my command
who cares if it's divine or demonic? ♪

01:51.310 --> 01:58.459
♪ Cracks, piercing through the heart ♪

01:58.460 --> 02:06.460
♪ Ethernity unbroken, love and
hate left behind, all passed by ♪

02:09.350 --> 02:14.970
♪ Cracks, piercing through the heart ♪

02:14.980 --> 02:21.979
♪ Armoured, at the
end of a vast battlefield ♪

02:21.980 --> 02:28.339
♪ Light slipping through my fingers ♪

02:28.340 --> 02:35.379
♪ When the end arrives,
no one will destroy me ♪

02:35.380 --> 02:41.659
♪ Forever unyielding ♪

02:41.660 --> 02:47.940
♪ Forever undying ♪

02:48.050 --> 02:50.250
World of Immortals

02:50.251 --> 02:51.310
Dragon Island Arc

02:51.820 --> 02:54.300
Episode 4

02:54.301 --> 02:56.780
Attack Formation

02:57.350 --> 02:58.669
Previous Episode

02:58.670 --> 03:00.430
There is evil dragon
roaming near the coast.

03:00.670 --> 03:02.606
Using a boat to leave the
island is definetely not feasible.

03:02.630 --> 03:03.870
I need to think of another way.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.899
Repeated attacks.

03:05.900 --> 03:07.740
Do you really think you can bully me?

03:10.840 --> 03:11.980
Four-armed giant ape.

03:12.910 --> 03:13.910
Jinghong.

03:16.390 --> 03:18.340
Was she rescued by that little unicorn?

03:20.480 --> 03:21.480
It's truly amazing.

03:22.470 --> 03:23.470
Brother Ape.

03:23.760 --> 03:24.900
This is your home.

03:24.990 --> 03:25.990
Not mine.

03:26.030 --> 03:28.340
It's about time to set off
and find the way home.

03:41.000 --> 03:43.510
I and Zhao Lin'er, both
fell onto this Dragon Island.

03:43.511 --> 03:48.070
Ancient Tree Forest

03:44.280 --> 03:46.600
It seems that Goddess Lanno
should also be on this island.

03:47.560 --> 03:49.030
But I don't know where she is now.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.430
How should I find her?

04:09.640 --> 04:11.080
Your abilities are quite impressive.

04:11.760 --> 04:13.070
Are you Xiao Chen?

04:13.440 --> 04:15.110
Are you from the Immortal World?

04:16.040 --> 04:17.270
Why did you ambush me?

04:18.590 --> 04:19.710
So it's you.

04:20.120 --> 04:21.910
The young master thinks highly of you.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.950
Even sent the three of us to capture you.

04:23.960 --> 04:25.270
Who is your young master?

04:25.720 --> 04:27.470
I shouldn't have a grudge against you.

04:28.960 --> 04:29.990
If you want to know,

04:30.400 --> 04:31.830
then come with me.

05:04.560 --> 05:05.830
Don't kill me.

05:05.920 --> 05:06.920
I surrender.

05:07.720 --> 05:09.790
Who is the young master you speak of?

05:10.520 --> 05:11.430
Spare me, great Hero.

05:11.520 --> 05:12.520
I will tell everything.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.560
Please spare me.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.600
Speak.

05:16.680 --> 05:18.230
I am from the Gu Family
in the Immortal World.

05:18.240 --> 05:19.670
When the young master
first came to the island,

05:19.680 --> 05:21.070
he met a beautiful woman.

05:21.320 --> 05:23.350
She claimed to be a Princess of Jiuzhou.

05:24.440 --> 05:27.190
The young master knew the
Princess had a grudge against you,

05:27.480 --> 05:30.830
so he ordered us to capture
you, to please the Princess.

05:31.280 --> 05:33.590
Hero, I was just doing my duty.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.670
Please spare me, spare my life.

05:36.320 --> 05:37.590
(It's that Zhao Lin'er again.)

05:38.280 --> 05:39.640
(If this woman is not eliminated, )

05:39.760 --> 05:42.480
(I will have a hard time focusing
on finding a way back to Jiuzhou.)

05:44.080 --> 05:46.670
Heart of the Lake Island

05:46.671 --> 05:49.260
Gu family Residence

05:47.600 --> 05:49.990
I wonder if Your Highness
is comfortable living here.

05:51.840 --> 05:53.390
It is very quiet and peaceful here.

05:53.560 --> 05:54.720
Comfortable and heartwarming.

05:54.960 --> 05:56.350
Brother Gu is very kind.

05:57.760 --> 05:58.950
Your Highness is too modest.

05:59.520 --> 06:00.470
If it weren't for Your Highness,

06:00.480 --> 06:02.440
I would have been swept
away by the sea long ago.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.510
Speaking of which, Your
Highness is my savior.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.990
This is a treasure
inherited from Gu Family,

06:11.160 --> 06:12.990
made from thousand-year-old
Phoenix branches.

06:15.520 --> 06:16.550
What does this mean?

06:19.640 --> 06:21.230
Your Highness has been kind to me.

06:21.600 --> 06:24.270
I cannot repay your kindness, so...

06:26.560 --> 06:28.310
Your good intentions have been accepted.

06:28.440 --> 06:30.670
But saving you was just a coincidence.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.150
I do not seek any repayment.

06:32.160 --> 06:33.950
I hope Brother Gu understands.

06:36.320 --> 06:37.670
Your Highness, please don't misunderstand.

06:37.680 --> 06:38.910
I have no other intentions.

06:39.880 --> 06:41.790
I just see that Your Highness is troubles.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.550
I wish to see Your Highness smile again.

06:44.080 --> 06:45.080
By the way,

06:45.360 --> 06:46.950
the person who previously
hurt Your Highness,

06:46.960 --> 06:48.430
I have sent someone to capture him.

06:53.040 --> 06:54.470
Go find some fruit to eat.

06:54.880 --> 06:56.270
Get some foe me too.

07:00.680 --> 07:02.070
Thank you, Brother Gu.

07:11.630 --> 07:16.300
Outside the Gu Family Residence

07:21.480 --> 07:22.470
Hey tell me,

07:22.480 --> 07:24.950
what kind of tricks did
this Princess of Jiuzhou use

07:25.520 --> 07:27.430
to make the young master so devoted to her.

07:28.760 --> 07:30.070
She is very beautiful.

07:30.400 --> 07:32.470
Nowadays, looks are everything

07:32.760 --> 07:33.870
(It seems that woman, )

07:33.960 --> 07:36.320
(is really involved with the
locals of the Immortal World.)

08:07.200 --> 08:07.870
Sir.

08:08.040 --> 08:09.160
The fish has taken the bait.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.560
Everything is arranged over there.

08:10.680 --> 08:12.590
We used strongest and most potent drug.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.110
Go inform the young master.

08:51.560 --> 08:52.560
(This...)

08:53.800 --> 08:54.990
(...what happened?)

09:04.680 --> 09:05.710
Incense?

09:12.160 --> 09:13.870
(It seems she was set up.)

09:17.600 --> 09:19.360
You harm others and
end up harming yourself.

09:19.800 --> 09:21.840
This is the price you
pay for using others to kill.

09:21.870 --> 09:22.670
Over here.

09:22.680 --> 09:23.310
Young master.

09:23.320 --> 09:24.630
Earlier I saw someone enter.

09:26.960 --> 09:27.960
Your Highness.

09:29.960 --> 09:31.030
What did you do to her?

09:37.640 --> 09:38.640
Xiao Chen.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.270
So you are Xiao Chen?

09:41.880 --> 09:42.950
This aroma,

09:42.960 --> 09:44.840
you actually resorted
to such a despicable act.

09:46.280 --> 09:47.830
I, Xiao Chen, act with integrity.

09:48.240 --> 09:51.390
If want to kill her, there's no
need to use such lowly methods.

09:51.680 --> 09:52.840
Still daring to make excuses!

10:04.480 --> 10:06.070
You shameless fool.

10:06.080 --> 10:07.160
Your Highness, don't worry.

10:07.320 --> 10:08.790
My men are on guard outside.

10:08.800 --> 10:09.800
He can't escape.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.120
Young Master.

10:20.400 --> 10:22.616
The Head of the Family
specifically instructed before leaving.

10:22.640 --> 10:23.750
The journey to Dragon Island,

10:23.760 --> 10:25.480
must not have any unexpected complications.

10:25.920 --> 10:27.830
Finding the Dragon King
is the most important.

10:29.320 --> 10:30.510
For me now,

10:30.680 --> 10:32.990
get this woman is the most important thing.

10:38.080 --> 10:38.830
Sir.

10:38.840 --> 10:41.100
I have already revealed
this location to Xiao Chen.

10:41.320 --> 10:43.070
I'm sure he will come soon.

10:43.840 --> 10:44.840
Very good.

10:44.920 --> 10:47.230
Later when delivering food,

10:47.360 --> 10:48.870
light this incense.

10:49.480 --> 10:51.910
Only if she dies at Xiao Chen's hands,

10:52.000 --> 10:54.790
will the Young Master focus
on important matters again.

11:05.680 --> 11:07.110
Your Highness, don't hurt yourself.

11:07.280 --> 11:09.710
After I capture him, I will
definitely hand him over to you.

11:10.030 --> 11:11.030
Everyone, move aside!

11:15.720 --> 11:17.110
I was just looking for you.

11:17.520 --> 11:19.470
Didn't expect you to come here to die.

11:20.080 --> 11:21.080
That's good too.

11:21.160 --> 11:22.870
Saves me a lot of time.

11:27.160 --> 11:28.910
Eight Scrolls of Transformation: Kill!

11:28.911 --> 11:33.140
Eight Scrolls of Transformation

11:35.960 --> 11:37.790
What's with these scrolls?

11:42.160 --> 11:44.030
My eight scrolls form a complete system,

11:44.040 --> 11:45.710
with both offense and defense in harmony.

11:45.720 --> 11:47.350
Where else can you escape to?

11:55.590 --> 11:56.590
Attack!

12:20.920 --> 12:22.070
Stop him for me.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.520
I swear I will kill him
today to vent my anger.

12:24.840 --> 12:26.640
Don't worry, Your
Highness, he won't escape.

12:32.520 --> 12:35.470
Eight Scrolls of Transformation,
Sealing Spirit of Darkness.

12:33.110 --> 12:35.959
Eight Scrolls of Transformation

12:35.471 --> 12:37.890
Sealing Spirit of Darkness

12:35.960 --> 12:36.960
Suppress

12:58.000 --> 12:59.350
Want to suppress me?

13:06.520 --> 13:10.310
Then let you try the energy
from the Eight-Armed Evil Dragon.

13:44.680 --> 13:45.350
Where is he?

13:45.360 --> 13:46.360
Where did he go?

13:47.800 --> 13:48.710
He can't escape.

13:48.720 --> 13:49.790
He must be around here.

13:50.320 --> 13:50.950
Chase him!

13:51.120 --> 13:52.120
Yes.

13:54.200 --> 13:55.200
Xiao Chen.

13:55.520 --> 13:56.600
Don't think about escaping.

14:00.120 --> 14:02.030
Sir, Xiao Chen has escaped.

14:02.280 --> 14:03.430
Your plan...

14:03.440 --> 14:04.440
Forget it.

14:05.400 --> 14:07.150
Humans are no match for the heavens.

14:08.360 --> 14:10.070
Due to the rules of Dragon Island,

14:10.240 --> 14:11.560
as someone of the Schicang Realm,

14:11.680 --> 14:13.270
I cannot act rashly.

14:13.760 --> 14:15.070
Stay close to Young Master.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.080
Don't make any mistakes.

14:16.200 --> 14:17.200
Yes.

14:20.030 --> 14:24.060
Silent Forest

14:37.040 --> 14:37.550
Young Master.

14:37.960 --> 14:38.976
There are footprints here.

14:39.000 --> 14:40.030
It must be him.

14:40.280 --> 14:40.830
Chase!

14:40.840 --> 14:41.840
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.680
(I've temporarily diverted them.)

14:49.240 --> 14:50.230
(That Young Master of the Gu Family, )

14:50.240 --> 14:52.360
(his strength far surpasses
Wang Zifeng and Liu Yue.)

14:52.400 --> 14:53.870
(With him protecting Zhao Lin'er, )

14:54.320 --> 14:56.230
(I must quickly increase my strength.)

15:27.760 --> 15:29.190
Why are traps here?

15:31.360 --> 15:32.790
This trap is very simple.

15:32.840 --> 15:34.470
How could anyone fall for it?

15:53.630 --> 15:58.399
Dragon Crystal Cave

15:58.400 --> 15:59.950
What is this place?

16:09.360 --> 16:10.590
Looks like...

16:10.800 --> 16:12.150
the Giant Dragon Skeleton?

16:12.560 --> 16:14.600
Could these crystals be
formed from dragon essence?

16:15.360 --> 16:17.550
They emit same energy as dragon eggs.

16:18.080 --> 16:20.110
They should help in enhancing cultivation.

16:23.840 --> 16:25.670
Such powerful dragon essence.

16:56.120 --> 16:57.270
A expected of Long Yuan.

16:57.400 --> 16:58.830
His aura is so powerful.

17:07.840 --> 17:09.310
What a peculiar crystal.

17:09.640 --> 17:12.630
It can actually channel all the
dragon essence here into my body.

17:17.150 --> 17:18.910
These crystals should be useful.

17:19.440 --> 17:20.440
Collect them all.

17:27.840 --> 17:29.800
Although this thing no
longer has dragon essence,

17:30.080 --> 17:31.910
it's still quite handy for self-defense.

17:45.030 --> 17:48.660
Three-Eyed Wolf

17:51.190 --> 17:59.190
[Swallowed Star Movie 07/12/2024]

18:53.760 --> 19:01.350
♪ A heart untouched by dust,
letting the past remain ♪

19:01.360 --> 19:06.960
♪ Old wounds hidden away by the years ♪

19:07.880 --> 19:15.190
♪ Turning through forgetfulness.
Fate is long-lasting ♪

19:15.440 --> 19:21.750
♪ Yet I still faintly remember your image ♪

19:22.000 --> 19:25.070
♪ Your gentle smile like the breeze. ♪

19:25.080 --> 19:29.099
♪ A light shadow flowing
like water, with no echo ♪

19:29.100 --> 19:31.999
♪ Grant me a lifetime of wind and snow ♪

19:32.000 --> 19:36.249
♪ Together, we'll admire the
moonlight until the end of time ♪

19:36.250 --> 19:40.569
♪ A glance back feels
like the first meeting ♪

19:40.570 --> 19:44.139
♪ The touch still warm to the skin ♪

19:44.140 --> 19:46.329
♪ The departed return to seek ♪

19:46.330 --> 19:50.339
♪ No regrets for the love once shared ♪

19:50.340 --> 19:52.969
♪ If only tender feelings
could last forever ♪

19:52.970 --> 19:57.180
♪ Nourishing beauty as
I look back once more ♪

19:57.320 --> 20:00.089
♪ I wish for the sea to remain untroubled ♪

20:00.090 --> 20:04.010
♪ The heart stays the same,
do not ponder too much ♪

20:04.350 --> 20:08.680
♪ That year by the jade zither,
listening to the flowers fall ♪

20:08.800 --> 20:12.329
♪ Ripples at the center of tears ♪

20:12.330 --> 20:14.289
♪ This love can wait ♪

20:14.290 --> 20:18.380
♪ To see that yellowing scene again ♪

20:19.350 --> 20:21.309
♪ Through the long years ♪

20:21.310 --> 20:25.820
♪ Together with you in vastness ♪

20:26.520 --> 20:29.409
♪ Asking the world ♪

20:29.410 --> 20:32.890
♪ How can love be complete? ♪

20:33.550 --> 20:36.609
♪ Remembering the past years ♪

20:36.610 --> 20:39.910
♪ Always feeling indebted ♪

20:40.630 --> 20:43.330
♪ When will we ♪

20:43.600 --> 20:47.629
♪ Meet again? ♪

20:47.630 --> 20:50.430
♪ Once stood side by side ♪

20:50.790 --> 20:54.740
♪ Talking for ages ♪

21:25.150 --> 21:26.829
Next Episode

21:26.830 --> 21:27.830
Bad.

21:27.980 --> 21:30.380
This creature seems very
concerned about the Dragon Crystal.

21:33.230 --> 21:34.660
The more dangerous the place,

21:35.030 --> 21:36.340
the easier it is to hide.

21:36.950 --> 21:39.620
I'm sure Xiao Chen must
be hiding in this area.

21:39.990 --> 21:41.220
Someone is coming this way.

21:41.630 --> 21:42.500
His life...

21:42.600 --> 21:44.420
I will take it personally.

21:46.150 --> 21:47.180
Kneel down,

21:47.510 --> 21:48.860
and surrender,

21:49.590 --> 21:51.540
I might consider sparing your life.

21:52.880 --> 21:53.880
You all...

21:54.780 --> 21:56.950
really deserve to die.
